OL,3,GNEWSASpecies 'at risk of vanishing'
OL,4,Afrom area of Wales' largest national
OL,5,Apark
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome of Wales' most endangered species
OL,8,Fare "at risk of vanishing" from an area
OL,9,Fof the country's largest national park,
OL,10,Fexperts have warned.
OL,12,FThe National Trust said Nant Ffrancon,
OL,13,Fa valley in Eryri National Park, was
OL,14,Ffacing "serious ecological decline"
OL,15,Fwith some species in danger of
OL,16,Fdisappearing altogether, including the
OL,17,Fmountain blackbird and the mountain
OL,18,Ffinch.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
