OL,3,GNEWSASpecies 'at risk of vanishing'
OL,4,Afrom area of Wales' largest national
OL,5,Apark
OL,6,
OL,7,FNow, a new #1m scheme is aiming to
OL,8,Frestore and conserve more than 4,000
OL,9,Facres of habitats at Eryri, also known
OL,10,Fas Snowdonia.
OL,12,F"We're in a very serious situation -
OL,13,Fwe're in a nature emergency. There are
OL,14,Fso many species in this valley which
OL,15,Fare on the brink of extinction," said
OL,16,FSimon Rogers from the National Trust.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
